                  "name": "Body",
                  "fill": "$ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 620,
                  "content": "I spent years experimenting with video, design, photography, and storytelling before moving deeply into mobile development. Those interests were never separate — they taught me how people notice, understand, and respond to experiences. Today, I use that perspective to build mobile products that are reliable, thoughtful, and easier to communicate.",
